WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
This is what 1.18 million gets you.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
Just not in Vancouver or Toronto.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.000
Allow me to reintroduce...

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
In our city Calgary, where space is interluxury, it's stiff.

00:11.000 --> 00:12.000
I use them on snow.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Open concept living that actually feels open.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Natural light in every corner.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Clean, modern design without the trade-off.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
You're minutes from downtown, but it feels like a completely different pace.

00:25.000 --> 00:29.000
In Vancouver or Toronto, 1.18 million buys you compromise.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
Here, it buys you some change.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
More space, more privacy, more home.

00:35.000 --> 00:36.000
Same budget.

00:36.000 --> 00:37.000
Different life.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
If you've been thinking about making a move, this is your sign.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.000
And it might be time.

00:47.000 --> 00:49.000
Calgary isn't the backup plan.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
It's the upgrade.

